          <guid>https://mhpark.me/posts/enter-entr/</guid>
          <description xml:base="https://mhpark.me/posts/enter-entr/">&lt;p&gt;Find yourself running a &lt;code&gt;pytest&lt;/code&gt; command repeatedly trying to work out
what a problem is and getting sick of clicking back on the terminal
window where the output is and pressing arrow up to re-run the test?
Or even running tests in an IDE and sick of re-running the test
time after time with your mouse?&lt;/p&gt;</description>
